{
  "projectId": "rooted_10y",
  "projectTitle": "Rooted — Tenure Facility Decade Explainer",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "S1",
      "title": "The Opening",
      "bgColor": "#0E0B08",
      "gentleZoom": false,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s1/seq/opening_thread/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S1_T1",
          "content": "Rooted.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 24,
          "heightVh": 12,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 22,
          "styleId": "title"
        },
        {
          "id": "S1_T2",
          "content": "A global initiative marking ten years of advancing land and forest rights.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 34,
          "heightVh": 14,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 42,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        },
        {
          "id": "S1_T3",
          "content": "What begins as a single thread becomes a living system.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 32,
          "heightVh": 14,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 66,
          "styleId": "body"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2",
      "title": "The Ecosystem",
      "bgColor": "#120E0A",
      "gentleZoom": false,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s2/seq/mycelium_growth/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S2_T1",
          "content": "A hundred-year-old tree did not arrive at its age alone.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 42,
          "heightVh": 20,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 18,
          "styleId": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "S2_T2",
          "content": "Long before the seed found the ground, a network was already threading through the soil — carrying nutrients, building connections, preparing conditions that the seed itself could never have created.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 38,
          "heightVh": 26,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 42,
          "styleId": "body"
        },
        {
          "id": "S2_T3",
          "content": "This is how lasting change begins: beneath the surface, before it becomes visible.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 34,
          "heightVh": 16,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 74,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3",
      "title": "Recognition, Not Creation",
      "bgColor": "#1A140E",
      "gentleZoom": false,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s3/seq/trunk_emergence/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S3_T1",
          "content": "The land rights movement is ancient. The decade did not create it — it recognized it.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 42,
          "heightVh": 24,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 20,
          "styleId": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "S3_T2",
          "content": "Over the past ten years, the Tenure Facility has helped recognize, resource, and strengthen work that was already rooted in communities, territories, and practice.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 36,
          "heightVh": 22,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 50,
          "styleId": "body"
        },
        {
          "id": "S3_T3",
          "content": "Not a new forest — but recognition, resourcing, and legal force for one that was already alive.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 34,
          "heightVh": 16,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 74,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S4",
      "title": "Reading the Rings",
      "bgColor": "#241A13",
      "gentleZoom": true,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s4/seq/rings_highlight/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S4_T1",
          "content": "When we read the rings, we are not reading the story of a single tree.",
          "textAlign": "center",
          "widthVw": 54,
          "heightVh": 16,
          "xPct": 23,
          "yPct": 12,
          "styleId": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "S4_T2",
          "content": "We are reading the story of an ecosystem — what was weathered, what was protected, and what was built over ten years.",
          "textAlign": "center",
          "widthVw": 50,
          "heightVh": 18,
          "xPct": 25,
          "yPct": 30,
          "styleId": "body"
        },
        {
          "id": "S4_T3",
          "content": "Land secured. Biodiversity protected. Ecosystems sustained. Communities strengthened. Climate resilience built.",
          "textAlign": "center",
          "widthVw": 48,
          "heightVh": 18,
          "xPct": 26,
          "yPct": 54,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S5",
      "title": "The Reframe",
      "bgColor": "#162118",
      "gentleZoom": true,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s5/seq/network_illumination/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S5_T1",
          "content": "The Tenure Facility is not the forest.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 34,
          "heightVh": 14,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 18,
          "styleId": "title"
        },
        {
          "id": "S5_T2",
          "content": "It is the network beneath it — essential, expansive, and most powerful when it is most invisible.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 34,
          "heightVh": 18,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 40,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        },
        {
          "id": "S5_T3",
          "content": "When the resources flow, the connections hold, and the trees can grow.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 30,
          "heightVh": 16,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 68,
          "styleId": "body"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S6",
      "title": "Rooted in Relation",
      "bgColor": "#2A2118",
      "gentleZoom": false,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s6/seq/rooted_in_relation/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S6_T1",
          "content": "Rooted in Relation",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 30,
          "heightVh": 12,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 18,
          "styleId": "title"
        },
        {
          "id": "S6_T2",
          "content": "Across continents and cultures, Indigenous, Afrodescendant, and local communities have always carried the same knowledge:",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 38,
          "heightVh": 18,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 40,
          "styleId": "body"
        },
        {
          "id": "S6_T3",
          "content": "That the land does not belong to them. They belong to it.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 34,
          "heightVh": 16,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 68,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S7",
      "title": "The Network Listens",
      "bgColor": "#171512",
      "gentleZoom": true,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s7/seq/network_listens/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S7_T1",
          "content": "What appeared to be isolated wisdom — separated by oceans, by languages, by centuries — reveals itself, when connected, as a single global body of knowledge.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 44,
          "heightVh": 26,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 16,
          "styleId": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "S7_T2",
          "content": "The Tenure Facility threads quietly beneath the surface. Listening. Carrying the signal.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 32,
          "heightVh": 16,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 58,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        },
        {
          "id": "S7_T3",
          "content": "Connection turns distance into solidarity.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 24,
          "heightVh": 12,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 78,
          "styleId": "body"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S8",
      "title": "Rooting for Change",
      "bgColor": "#20170F",
      "gentleZoom": true,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s8/seq/rooting_for_change/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S8_T1",
          "content": "Rooting for Change",
          "textAlign": "center",
          "widthVw": 40,
          "heightVh": 12,
          "xPct": 30,
          "yPct": 14,
          "styleId": "title"
        },
        {
          "id": "S8_T2",
          "content": "Ten years. Ten rings. 4.5 million hectares secured in 2024 alone. 34 million hectares strengthened. 35 projects. 18 countries.",
          "textAlign": "center",
          "widthVw": 52,
          "heightVh": 20,
          "xPct": 24,
          "yPct": 34,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        },
        {
          "id": "S8_T3",
          "content": "Ancient wisdom, when resourced and legally protected, produces measurable, documented, irreversible change.",
          "textAlign": "center",
          "widthVw": 46,
          "heightVh": 16,
          "xPct": 27,
          "yPct": 68,
          "styleId": "body"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S9",
      "title": "The Living Map & Digital Platform",
      "bgColor": "#11161A",
      "gentleZoom": false,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s9/seq/living_platform/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S9_T1",
          "content": "The Living Map & Digital Platform",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 38,
          "heightVh": 16,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 18,
          "styleId": "title"
        },
        {
          "id": "S9_T2",
          "content": "The living archive and experiential destination that every other touchpoint ultimately points toward.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 34,
          "heightVh": 18,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 42,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        },
        {
          "id": "S9_T3",
          "content": "A permanent infrastructure for data, stories, and community contribution — built to grow beyond 2027.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 34,
          "heightVh": 18,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 68,
          "styleId": "body"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "title": "The Celebratory Film & Shorts",
      "bgColor": "#161110",
      "gentleZoom": false,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s10/seq/film_and_shorts/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S10_T1",
          "content": "The Celebratory Film & Shorts",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 38,
          "heightVh": 16,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 18,
          "styleId": "title"
        },
        {
          "id": "S10_T2",
          "content": "The feature film moves through all three movements. Short-form content travels through social, cultural, and community channels, reaching audiences that no institutional communication can access.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 38,
          "heightVh": 24,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 40,
          "styleId": "body"
        },
        {
          "id": "S10_T3",
          "content": "One cohesive story of the decade, carried in forms built to travel.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 30,
          "heightVh": 14,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 74,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "title": "The Immersive Experience & Anniversary Event",
      "bgColor": "#18140F",
      "gentleZoom": true,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s11/seq/forest_of_voices/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S11_T1",
          "content": "The Immersive Experience & Anniversary Event",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 40,
          "heightVh": 18,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 16,
          "styleId": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "S11_T2",
          "content": "The Forest of Voices is the sensory and emotional center of Rooted — a multi-ring installation unfolding as a journey across time, territory, and community voice.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 38,
          "heightVh": 22,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 40,
          "styleId": "body"
        },
        {
          "id": "S11_T3",
          "content": "The opening address. The conversion moment. The place where the forest becomes visible all at once.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 34,
          "heightVh": 18,
          "xPct": 8,
          "yPct": 72,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "title": "Roots of Abundance",
      "bgColor": "#22301F",
      "gentleZoom": false,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s12/seq/roots_of_abundance/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S12_T1",
          "content": "Roots of Abundance",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 32,
          "heightVh": 12,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 18,
          "styleId": "title"
        },
        {
          "id": "S12_T2",
          "content": "This is not a story about the future. It is a story about what these communities have always known is possible — and what becomes real when the network holds.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 38,
          "heightVh": 22,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 40,
          "styleId": "body"
        },
        {
          "id": "S12_T3",
          "content": "When communities have secure rights to their territories, the land thrives, the climate benefits, and the forest grows.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 34,
          "heightVh": 18,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 72,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "title": "The Invitation",
      "bgColor": "#0F0C0A",
      "gentleZoom": false,
      "media": {
        "srcPattern": "/assets/s13/seq/final_invitation/frame_%04d.webp"
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "S13_T1",
          "content": "Rooted is a global multimedia activation marking ten years of the land rights movement.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 42,
          "heightVh": 20,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 18,
          "styleId": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "S13_T2",
          "content": "A film. A living map. An immersive experience.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 28,
          "heightVh": 14,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 48,
          "styleId": "bodyStrong"
        },
        {
          "id": "S13_T3",
          "content": "Built with the communities whose stories it carries.",
          "textAlign": "left",
          "widthVw": 26,
          "heightVh": 12,
          "xPct": 10,
          "yPct": 72,
          "styleId": "body"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
